hadiths[31]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1493","Noman bin Bashir sey usi jaisi hadees aai hai. Qatada kehtey hain ke unhoney kaha : Habib bin Salim key paas ye masla likh kar bheja gaya. abu-Bashar ney bhi ye hadees Habib bin Salim sey nahin suni , unhoney isey Khalid bin Arfata sey riwayat kiya hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Noman ki hadees ki sanad mein iztirab (ikhtilaaf) hai mainey Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari ko kehtey suna ke Qatada ney is hadees ko Habib bin Salim sey nahin suna hai, unhoney isey Khalid bin Arfataa sey riwayat kiya hai. 2- is bab mein Salma bin Muhbiq sey bhi riwayat hai, 3- biwi ki laundi key sath zina karney waley key silsiley mein ehle-ilm ka ikhtilaf hai, chunanche Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key kaee Sahaba sey marvi (riwayat hui) hai jin mein Ali aur ibne-Umar bhi shamil hain ke is par rajm wajib hai, ibne-Masood kehtey hain is par koi had nahin hai, albatta uski islaahi saza hogi , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka maslak is ( hadees ( key mutabiq hai jo Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey ba-wasta Noman bin Bashir aai hai."
"1494","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key zamaney main eik aurat key sath zabardasti zina kiya gaya, to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney isey had sey bari kar diya aur zaani par had jari ki. Raavi ney is ka zikr nahin kiya ke aap ney isey kuchh mehar bhi dilaaya ho. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai, iski asnaad muttasil nahin hai. 2- ye hadees dusri sanad sey bhi aai hai. 3- mainey Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari ko kehtey huye suna : Abdul-Jabbaar bin Wayl bin Hajar ka samaa, unkey baap sey sabit nahin hai, unhoney apney walid ka zamana nahin paya hai, kaha jata hai ke wo apney walid ki maut key kuchh mahiney baad paida huye. 4- Sahaba kiram mein sey baaz ehle-ilm aur kuchh doosrey logon ka isi par amal hai ke jis sey jabran zina kiya gaya ho is par had wajib nahin hai."
"1495","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key zamaney main eik aurat namaz key liye nikli, usey eik aadmi mila , usney aurat ko dhanp liya aur us sey apni hajat puri ki (yani us sey zabardasti zina kiya), wo aurat cheekhney lagi aur wo chala gaya, phir uskey paas sey eik (doosra) aadmi guzra to ye aurat boli : is (doosray) aadmi ney merey sath aisa-aisa (yani zina) kiya hai padhi. aur uskey paas sey muhajrin ki bhi eik jamaat guzri to ye aurat boli : is aadmi ney merey sath aisa aisa (yani zina) kiya hai, ( ye sun kar) wo log gaey aur ja kar unhoney us aadmi ko pakad liya jis key barey mein us aurat ney guman kiya tha ke usi ney uskey sath zina kiya hai aur usey is aurat key paas laye, wo boli : haan , wo yehi hai, phir wo log usey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas laye, chunanche jab aap ney isey rajm karney ka hukm diya, to us aurat key sath zina karney wala khada huwa aur usney arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! uskey sath zina karney wala main hun, phir aap ney us aurat sey farmaya : ''tu ja Allah ney teri bakhshish kar di hai.'' aur aap ney us aadmi ko (jo qasurwaar nahin tha) achchhi baat kahi padhi. aur jis aadmi ney zina kiya tha uskey mutalliq aap ney farmaya : ''usey rajm karo''  aap ney ye bhi farmaya : ''us (zaani) ney aisi tauba ki hai ke agar ehale Madina is tarah tauba kar lein to un sab ki tauba qubul ho jaey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib sahih hai. 2- Alqama bin Wayl bin Hajar ka samaa (sun'na), unkey walid sey Sabit hai, ye Abdul-Jabbaar bin Wayl sey badey hain aur Abdul-Jabbaar ka samaa, unkey walid sey sabit nahin."
"1496","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jis aadmi ko janwer key sath wati (sambhog) kartey huye paao to usey qatl kar do aur (sath mein) janwer ko bhi qatl kar do.'' Abdullah bin Abbas Raziallahu anhuma sey puchha gaya : janwer ko qatl karney ki kya wajeh hai? unhoney kaha : mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey is silsiley mein kuchh nahin suna hai, lekin mera khayal hai ke jis janwer key sath ye bura kaam kiya gaya ho, uska gosht khaney aur us sey faeyda uthaney ko Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney napasand samjha. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Amr bin abi Amr ki hadees ko jisey wo ba-tareeq : (Akrama an ibne-Abbas an Nabi sallallahu Alehi wasallam) riwayat kartey hain. hum sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain."
"1497","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''tum log jisey qome-Loot ka amal (ighlaam-bazi) kartey huye paao to faail (karta) aur mafool (karm) (bura kaam karney aur karaney waley) dono ko qatl kar do. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees ba-wasta ibne-Abbas Raziallahu anhuma Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey sirf isi sanad sey jaani jati hai, Muhammad bin Is-haq ney bhi is hadees ko Amr bin abi Amr sey riwayat kiya hai, (lekin is mein hai) aap ney farmaya : ''qome-Loot ka amal (ighlaam-bazi) karney wala maloon hai.''  Raavi ney is hadees mein qatl ka zikr nahin kiya, albatta is mein ye bayan hai ke janwer sey wati (sambhog) karney wala maloon hai.''  aur ye hadees ba-tareeq : Aasim bin umr an Suhail bin Abi Saleh an Abeeh an Abi Huraira an Nabi Sallallahu Alehi wasallam) riwayat ki gaee hai. (is mein hai ke) aap ney farmaya : ''faail (karm) aur mafool (karta) dono ko qatl kar do.''  2- is hadees ki sanad mein kalam hai, hum nahin jantey ke isey Suhel bin abi Saleh sey Aasim bin umr Al Umri key ilawa kisi aur ney riwayat kiya hai aur Aasim bin umr ka haal ye hai ke wo apney hifz key talluq sey hadees bayan karney mein zaeef hain. 3- is bab mein Jabir aur Abu-Hurera Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 4- ighlaam-bazi (bura kaam) karney waley ki had key silsiley mein ehle-ilm ka ikhtilaf hai, baaz kehtey hain : bura kaam karney wala shaadi shuda ho ya ghair shaadi shuda uski saza rajm hai, Malik Shafai , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka yehi qol hai. 5- Fuqaha Tabe-een mein sey baaz ehle-ilm ney jin mein Hasan Basri , Ibrahim Nakhai aur Ata bin abi Ribah waghera shamil hain kehtey hain : bura kaam karney waley ki saza zaani ki saza ki tarah hai, Sory aur ehle-Koofa ka yehi qol hai."
"1498","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' mujhey apni ummat key barey mein jis chiz ka sab sey ziyada khof hai wo qome-Loot ka amal (ighlaam-bazi) hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai. 2- aur hum isey sirf isi sanad « an Abdullah bin Muhammad bin Aqeel bin abi Talib an Jabir » sey hi jantey hain."
"1499","Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ney kuchh aisey logon ko zinda jala diya jo Islam sey murtad ho gaey they, jab ibne-Abbas Raziallahu anhuma ko ye baat malum hui padhi. to unhoney kaha : agar (Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ki jagah) main hota to unhen qatl karta , kyonkey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ka farman hai : ''jo apney Deen (Islam) ko badal daley usey qatl karo.'' , aur main unhen jalata nahin kyonkey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ka farman hai : ''Allah key azabe-khaas jaisa tum log azab na do.'' , phir is baat ki khabar Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ko hui to unhoney kaha : ibne-Abbas Raziallahu anhuma ney sach kaha. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees sahih Hasan hai. 2- murtad key silsiley mein ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai. 3- jab aurat Islam sey murtad ho jaey to uskey barey mein ulama ka ikhtilaf hai, ehle-ilm ki eik jamaat kehti hai : usey qatl kya jaeyga, Auzaai , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka yehi qol hai. 4- aur ehle-ilm ki dusri jamaat kehti hai : usey qatl nahin balke qaid kiya jaeyga, Sufiyan Sory aur unkey ilawa baaz ehle-Koofa ka yehi qol hai."
"1500","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jo hamarey khilaf hathiyar uthaey wo hum mein sey nahin hai.'' is baab mein ibne-Umar , ibn Zuber , Abu-Hurera aur Salma bin Akwaa (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"1501","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jadugar ki saza talwaar sey gardan maarna hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sey bhi marvi (riwayat hui) hai, aur sahih ye hai ke Jundub sey moqufan marvi hai. 2- hum is hadees ko sirf isi sanad sey marfoo jantey hain. 3- Ismail bin Muslim Makki apney hifz key talluq sey hadees bayan karney mein zaeef hain, aur Ismail bin Muslim jinki nisbat Abdi aur Basraa hai Wakee ney unhen bharosemand kaha hai. 4- Sahaba kiram mein sey baaz ehle-ilm Sahaba aur kuchh doosrey logon ka isi par amal hai, Malik bin Anas ka yehi qol hai. 5- Shafai kehtey hain : jab jadugar ka jadu kufr ki had tak pahunchey to usey qatl kiya jaeyga aur jab uska jadu hade-kufr tak na pahunchey to hum samajhtey hain ke uska qatl nahin hai."
"1502","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jis shakhs ko Allah ki raah mein maal (ghanimat) mein khayanat kartey huye paao uska saman jala do.'' Saleh kehtey hain : main Muslima key paas gaya, unkey sath Salim bin Abdullah they to Muslima ney eik aisey aadmi ko paya jisney maale-ghanimat mein khayanat ki thi, chunanche Salim ney ( un sey) ye hadees bayan ki, to Muslima ney hukm diya phir us ( khaain (ka saman jala diya gaya aur uskey saman main eik mushaf (kitab) bhi paya gaya to Salim ney kaha : isey bech do aur iski qeemat sadqa kar do. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai, hum isey sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain. 2- mainey Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari sey is hadees key barey mein puchha to unhoney kaha : isey Saleh bin Muhammad bin zyada ney riwayat kiya hai, yehi abu Waqid Laisi hai, ye hadees ke munkir hai. 3- Bukhari kehtey hain ke maale ghanimat mein khayanat karney waley key silsiley mein Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey dusri ahadees bhi aai hain, aap ney un mein is (khaain) key saman jalane ka hukm nahin diya hai. 4- baaz ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai, Auzaai , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka yehi qol hai."
"1503","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jab koi aadmi doosrey ko Yahudi keh kar pukarey to usey bees kodey lagaao , aur jab mukhannas (hijdaa) keh kar pukarey to usey bees kodey lagaao , aur jo kisi mohrim (aehraam ki haalat me) key sath zina karey usey qatl kar do.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- hum is hadees ko sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain. 2- Ibrahim bin Ismail bin Aleh hadees ki riwayat mein zaeef hain. 3- Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey ye kaee sanadon sey marvi hai. 4- Bara bin Aazib aur Qurra bin Ayas Muzni sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi ney apney baap ki biwi sey nikah kiya to Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney usey qatl karney ka hukm diya. 5- hamarey as-haab (muhaddeseen) ka isi par amal hai, ye log kehtey hain : jo jantey huye kisi mohrim key sath zina karey to is par qatl wajib hai. 6- (Imam) Ahmed kehtey hain : jo apni maa sey nikah karega usey qatl kya jaeyga. 7- Is-haq bin Raahviya kehtey hain : jo kisi mohrim key sath zina karey usey qatl kiya jaeyga."
"1504","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam farmaya : '' das sey ziyada kisi ko kodey na lagaey jaeyn padhi. siwaye uskey ke Allah ki hudood mein sey koi had jari karna ho.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai, hum isey sirf Bakeer bin Ashajj ki riwayat sey jantey hain. 2- saza key silsiley mein ehle-ilm ka ikhtilaf hai, saza key baab mein ye hadees sab sey achchhi hai. 3- is hadees ko ibne-Lahiaa ney Bakeer sey riwayat kiya hai, lekin un sey is sanad mein ghalati hui hai, unhoney sanad is tarah bayan ki hai : « an Abdur-Rehman bin Jabir bin Abdullah an Abeeh an Nabi sallallahu Alehi wasallam » halanke ye ghalat hai, sahih Les bin Saad ki hadees hai, iski sanad is tarah hai : (عبدالرحمٰن بن جابر بن عبد الله an أبي بردة بن نيار an النبِ صلى الله عليه وسلم)."
"1505","Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne ek sooratdar, seedha-paithth wale, singdar nar bakri ka qurbani kiya."
"1506","Abu Kibash (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki keh: \Main ek Jadha' (ek saal ka bachra) Al-Madinah Munawwarah le gaya tha (bechne ke liye)"","" lekin woh mere paas hi reh gaya. Main ne Abu Hurairah (رضي الله"""""
"1507","Hazrat Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) ne farmaya: \n\Hum Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke saath safar mein the"","" jab Eid-ul-Adha ka din aa gaya.\"""""""
"1508","Jabir (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki: \Hum Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke saath Al-Hudaibiyyah mein Nahr (qurbani) ki: Saath aadmi ke liye ek aurat-e-saani (camel) aur saath aadmi ke liye ek gaay (cow).\"""""""
"1509","Hujayyah bin 'Adi riwayat karte hain ke Ali ne kaha: \Ek gaaye ke liye (zaakat mein) saat (ashkhaas) hain.\"" Maine poocha: \""Agar usne janam de de toh?\"" Unhon ne kaha: \""Toh uske bachche ko bhi uss ke saath qurbaan kar do.\"" Maine poocha: \""Agar langri ho toh?\"" Unhon ne kaha: \""Jab tak maqam-e-manasik ki rasam pahunch na jaaye.\"" Maine poocha: \""Agar uska singa toota ho toh?\"" Unhon ne kaha: \""Koi haraj nahi.\""\n\n\n*Hadith Reference: Tirmidhi"","" Zakat 14; Abu Dawud"","" Zakat 1581; graded Sahih by al-Albani.*"""""
"1510","Hazrat Ali (Razi Allah unho) ne riwayat farmaya ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us janwar ko qurbani karne se mana farmaya jis ki seengh ya kaan mein A'dab (khonda hua tukda) ho. Qatadah (jis ne hadith bayan ki) ne farmaya ke main ne yeh baat Sa'eed bin Al-Musayyab (Rahmatullah Alaih) ko batayi to unhone farmaya ke A'dab woh hai jo is barabar ya is se zyada ho."
"1511","Hazrat Ata bin Yasar (rhmt all alyh) rwayt krtay hyn kh myn nay hzrt abw aywb ansary (rzy allh anh) say swal kya kh rswl allh (ﷺ) kay zmanay myn zbh kysay kya jata tha۔ anhwn nay frmaya: \ayk shkhs apnay awr apnay ghr walwn kay lyay ayk bkry zbh krta۔ wh khwd as say khatay awr dwsrwn kw khlatay۔\"""""""
"1512","Jabalah bin Suhaim ne riwayat ki ek mard ne Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se Udhiyah ke bare mein sawal kiya."
"1513","Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai: \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne Madinah Munawwarah mein dalaah saal tak Udhiyah (qurbani) ki.\"""""""
"1514","Al-Bara' bin 'Azib (رضي الله عنهما) ne riwayat ki ke: Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne Humein Yaum-e-Nahr (Qurbani ka Din) par khutba diya aur farmaya: \Tum mein se koi shakhs Namaz padhle"","" is qabl woh qurbani na kare.\"" Unhon ne kaha: \""Meri khala ke bete khade hue aur kaha: 'Ya Rasoolullah (ﷺ)!'\"""""""
"1515","Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Tum mein se koi shakhs apne qurbani ke gosht se teen din se zyada na khaaye.\"""""""
"1516","Suleman bin Buraidah (rzy allh anh) apnay wald (rzy allh anh) say rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya:\n\n\myn tmhyn qrbany ka gwsht tyn dn say zyadh khanay say mna kya krta takh js shkhs kw wsat hw wh as kw day js kw nh hw۔ ab tm jysay chahw khao۔\"""""""
"1517","Hazrat Abis bin Rabi'ah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki: \Main ne Ummul Momineen (radiyallahu anha) se poocha: 'Kya Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qurbani ke gosht se mana farmaya tha?' Unhon ne farmaya: 'Nahi.'\"""""""
"1518","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) se rivayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Na Fara' hai na Atirah.\"" Fara' woh pehla bachcha hota hai jo unke (gharb ke) gosht ke janwaron mein paida hota hai."""""
"1519","Yusuf bin Mahak ne riwayat ki: Woh Hafsah bint Abdur-Rahman ke paas akele mein aaye taake un se Aqeeqah ke baare mein poochh-tachh karein. Unhon ne unhe bataya ke Aishah ne unhe bataya tha."
"1520","Ubaidullah bin Abi Rafi' ne riwayat ki ke unke baap ne farmaya: \Main ne Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ko dekha ke woh Hasan bin Ali (رضی اللہ عنہما) کے کان میں اذان پڑھ رہے تھے - جب ان کی ولادت Fatimah (رضی اللہ عنہا) سے ہوئی تھی - نماز کی اذان۔"""""
"1521","Umm Kurz (rz all anha) say rwayt hay kh anhwn nay rswl allh (ﷺ) say aqyqay kay baray myn swal kya۔ aap (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \lrkay kay lyay dw bhyryan (zbh ky jaty hyn)۔\"""""""
"1522","Mikhnaf bin Sulaim (رضي الله عنه) ne rivaayat ki ke hum Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ke saath Arafat mein khade the jab maine unhen farmaya: \Aey logo! Har ghar wale ke liye har saal mein Udhiyah (qurbaani) aur Atirah hai. Kya tum jaante ho Atirah kya hai? Wahi hai jise tum Rajabiyyah kehte ho.\"""""""
"1523","Muhammad bin Ali bin Al-Husain ne riwayat ki ke Ali bin Abi Talib (رضي الله عنه) ne farmaya: \Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ne Hazrat Hasan (رضي الله"""""
